.06,4.4]},{"text":"However, his song Babydoll has recently achieved massive success on social media platforms.","voice":"voice/2026-10-19-culture-singer-jamie-miller-scores/t3-1.m4a","dur":6.42,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-19-culture-singer-jamie-miller-scores/ja/t3-1.m4a","durJa":7.66,"times":[0.0,0.5,0.6,0.84,1.8,2.3,2.72,3.2,3.84,4.48,4.88,5.12,5.52]},{"text":"Actor Antonio Cipriano, who stars in Off Campus, expressed his admiration for the track.","voice":"voice/2026-10-19-culture-singer-jamie-miller-scores/t3-2.m4a","dur":5.99,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-19-culture-singer-jamie-miller-scores/ja/t3-2.m4a","durJa":7.18,"times":[0.0,0.26,0.54,1.98,2.06,2.3,2.6,2.84,3.98,4.18,4.52,4.78,5.36,5.48]},{"text":"Miller subsequently invited Cipriano to collaborate on a new recording of the song.","voice":"voice/2026-10-19-culture-singer-jamie-miller-scores/t3-3.m4a","dur":4.83,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-19-culture-singer-jamie-miller-scores/ja/t3-3.m4a","durJa":6.15,"times":[0.0,0.2,0.76,1.46,2.28,2.46,2.88,3.34,3.44,3.64,4.02,4.32,4.42]},{"text":"The pair quickly became close friends after they met in Los Angeles to record.","voice":"voice/2026-10-19-culture-singer-jamie-miller-scores/t3-4.m4a","dur":4.31,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-19-culture-singer-jamie-miller-scores/ja/t3-4.m4a","durJa":5.25,"times":[0.0,0.08,0.26,0.66,1.12,1.46,1.94,2.34,2.54,2.7,2.84,3.0,3.36,3.66]},{"text":"Cipriano has even joined Miller on stage during a major American concert tour.","voice":"voice/2026-10-19-culture-singer-jamie-miller-scores/t3-5.m4a","dur":5.29,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-19-culture-singer-jamie-miller-scores/ja/t3-5.m4a","durJa":6.21,"times":[0.0,0.6,0.78,1.02,1.32,1.64,1.94,2.28,2.78,2.94,3.2,3.82,4.18]}],"bands":{"core1000":80,"core1800":7,"ngsl":6,"tsl":1,"nawl":0,"beyond":6}},"t4":{"sentences":[{"text":"Welsh musician Jamie Miller had considered quitting the music industry before his single Babydoll went viral.","voice":"voice/2026-10-19-culture-singer-jamie-miller-scores/t4-0.m4a","dur":6.88,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-19-culture-singer-jamie-miller-scores/ja/t4-0.m4a","durJa":9.02,"times":[0.0,0.3,0.9,1.38,1.78,2.18,2.58,3.04,3.32,3.52,4.08,4.54,4.86,5.18,5.96,6.2]},{"text":"The track rapidly gained traction on social media and eventually climbed to the top of digital charts.","voice":"voice/2026-10-19-culture-singer-jamie-miller-scores/t4-1.m4a","dur":5.84,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-19-culture-singer-jamie-miller-scores/ja/t4-1.m4a","durJa":7.61,"times":[0.0,0.06,0.26,0.8,1.12,1.48,1.86,2.08,2.5,3.06,3.48,3.8,4.1,4.16,4.52,4.74,4.94]},{"text":"After noticing positive comments online, Miller reached out to American actor Antonio Cipriano regarding a potential collaboration.","voice":"voice/2026-10-19-culture-singer-jamie-miller-scores/t4-2.m4a","dur":7.98,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-19-culture-singer-jamie-miller-scores/ja/t4-2.m4a","durJa":10.07,"times":[0.0,0.2,0.52,1.12,1.48,2.7,2.72,3.08,3.34,3.52,3.8,4.4,4.9,5.94,6.32,6.6,6.82]},{"text":"Cipriano, who stars in the popular streaming series Off Campus, agreed enthusiastically to join the project.","voice":"voice/2026-10-19-culture-singer-jamie-miller-scores/t4-3.m4a","dur":6.69,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-19-culture-singer-jamie-miller-scores/ja/t4-3.m4a","durJa":8.15,"times":[0.0,0.8,0.92,1.12,1.36,1.44,1.84,2.16,2.78,3.08,4.02,4.28,4.8,5.68,5.86,6.02]},{"text":"A joint version of the song was recorded in Los Angeles shortly after the two performers met in person.","voice":"voice/2026-10-19-culture-singer-jamie-miller-scores/t4-4.m4a","dur":5.18,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-19-culture-singer-jamie-miller-scores/ja/t4-4.m4a","durJa":6.71,"times":[0.0,0.04,0.24,0.62,0.82,0.94,1.16,1.36,1.7,1.98,2.12,2.48,3.06,3.48,3.64,3.8,4.16,4.5,4.62]},{"text":"Miller later reported that performing alongside Cipriano at an arena concert was an extraordinary milestone for both artists.","voice":"voice/2026-10-19-culture-singer-jamie-miller-scores/t4-5.m4a","dur":7.15,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-19-culture-singer-jamie-miller-scores/ja/t4-5.m4a","durJa":9.5,"times":[0.0,0.18,0.5,0.92,1.3,1.64,2.14,3.08,3.26,3.36,3.54,4.1,4.44,4.58,5.08,5.76,6.22,6.4]},{"text":"The original track subsequently reached the second spot on the official music chart in the United Kingdom.","voice":"voice/2026-10-19-culture-singer-jamie-miller-scores/t4-6.m4a","dur":6.78,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-19-culture-singer-jamie-miller-scores/ja/t4-6.m4a","durJa":6.31,"times":[0.0,0.38,0.64,1.1,1.74,2.18,2.42,2.78,3.12,3.4,3.48,3.8,4.24,4.46,4.78,4.88,5.02]}],"bands":{"core1000":70,"core1800":9,"ngsl":7,"tsl":6,"nawl":0,"beyond":8}},"t5":{"sentences":[{"text":"Facing severe financial and emotional pressure in early 2026, singer Jamie Miller was on the verge of abandoning his musical career.","voice":"voice/2026-10-19-culture-singer-jamie-miller-scores/t5-0.m4a","dur":9.39,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-19-culture-singer-jamie-miller-scores/ja/t5-0.m4a","durJa":11.39,"times":[0.0,0.32,0.78,1.46,1.92,2.22,2.86,3.26,3.52,5.18,5.48,5.84,6.2,6.56,6.7,6.82,7.06,7.4,7.98,8.32,8.68]},{"text":"However, his energetic single Babydoll unexpectedly ignited an online craze, propelling him to the apex of the US iTunes pop chart.","voice":"voice/2026-10-19-culture-singer-jamie-miller-scores/t5-1.m4a","dur":9.49,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-19-culture-singer-jamie-miller-scores/ja/t5-1.m4a","durJa":10.79,"times":[0.0,0.58,0.72,1.14,1.64,2.5,3.28,4.02,4.4,4.68,5.92,6.34,6.5,6.66,6.78,7.18,7.64,7.76,8.06,8.58,8.96]},{"text":"The song's viral momentum intensified when actor Antonio Cipriano, known for his role in the hit series Off Campus, publicly praised the track.","voice":"voice/2026-10-19-culture-singer-jamie-miller-scores/t5-2.m4a","dur":9.41,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-19-culture-singer-jamie-miller-scores/ja/t5-2.m4a","durJa":11.58,"times":[0.0,0.1,0.46,0.8,1.24,2.06,2.78,3.08,3.66,4.7,5.02,5.22,5.36,5.56,5.78,5.88,6.04,6.36,6.78,7.76,8.14,8.54,8.92]},{"text":"Miller promptly contacted the actor, culminating in a spontaneous studio session in Los Angeles where the duo recorded a collaborative version.","voice":"voice/2026-10-19-culture-singer-jamie-miller-scores/t5-3.m4a","dur":8.18,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-19-culture-singer-jamie-miller-scores/ja/t5-3.m4a","durJa":9.8,"times":[0.0,0.22,0.62,1.32,1.52,2.5,2.56,2.9,2.98,3.38,4.04,4.54,4.8,4.92,5.34,5.98,6.1,6.3,6.62,7.04,7.3]},{"text":"Beyond their studio chemistry, the artists formed an immediate bond, describing their instant personal connection as a rare finding in the entertainment industry.","voice":"voice/2026-10-19-culture-singer-jamie-miller-scores/t5-4.m4a","dur":8.95,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-19-culture-singer-jamie-miller-scores/ja/t5-4.m4a","durJa":11.47,"times":[0.0,0.28,0.5,0.78,1.82,1.98,2.24,2.64,2.92,3.22,4.18,4.54,4.88,5.2,5.62,6.18,6.66,6.72,7.0,7.48,7.78,7.86,8.3]},{"text":"Their growing friendship reached new heights when Miller invited Cipriano to perform alongside him during a major US arena tour.","voice":"voice/2026-10-19-culture-singer-jamie-miller-scores/t5-5.m4a","dur":7.63,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-19-culture-singer-jamie-miller-scores/ja/t5-5.m4a","durJa":10.26,"times":[0.0,0.12,0.42,0.82,1.22,1.58,1.94,2.46,2.66,3.32,3.92,4.08,4.34,4.82,5.38,5.84,5.96,6.3,6.66,7.1]},{"text":"Meanwhile, the original recording of Babydoll climbed to second place on the official UK charts, trailing only a release by Taylor Swift.","voice":"voice/2026-10-19-culture-singer-jamie-miller-scores/t5-6.m4a","dur":7.74,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-19-culture-singer-jamie-miller-scores/ja/t5-6.m4a","durJa":7.82,"times":[0.0,0.6,0.7,0.94,1.52,1.76,2.22,2.56,2.88,3.16,3.58,3.82,3.92,4.24,4.57,5.44,5.76,6.26,6.36,6.62,6.84,7.02]},{"text":"Reflecting on his dramatic turnaround, Miller expressed profound gratitude for the opportunity to share his music with thousands of enthusiastic fans each night.","voice":"voice/2026-10-19-culture-singer-jamie-miller-scores/t5-7.m4a","dur":9.8,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-19-culture-singer-jamie-miller-scores/ja/t5-7.m4a","durJa":10.